 "scratch": "设计两个保护区。A区：原120，迁入45，迁出30。B区：原110，迁入20，迁出50。计算A区最终：120+45-30=135。B区最终：110+20-50=80。差值：135-80=55。干扰项设计：A区算错（如漏加迁入得90，差10；或漏减迁出得165，差85）；B区算错；直接加减所有数等。",
 "solver_code": "from fractions import Fraction\ndef solve():\n    # A区\n    a_start = 120\n    a_in = 45\n    a_out = 30\n    a_final = a_start + a_in - a_out\n    \n    # B区\n    b_start = 110\n    b_in = 20\n    b_out = 50\n    b_final = b_start + b_in - b_out\n    \n    diff = a_final - b_final\n    return [diff]",
